Planning for 1.7 is almost done.  Development work should start next week.

With 1.6 release we are updating all the BSP's and layers.

Beth - Anyone with a corporate BSP that they want on the Yocto site, please=
 work with Beth.  See https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Third_Party_BSP_Re=
lease_Process

Beth - 1.5.2 Will release today.

Beth - 1.4.4 Two issues found in QA and fixes found to fix both issues.  Sh=
ould be released early next week.



* SWAT team rotation: Saul -> Ross

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Team

* Opens - 10 min

Beth - OPW Intern - We have a new OPW intern named Lynn.  She will be worki=
ng with Beth on AutoBuilder and the release process.

Dave - New manager of Intel Yocto team is David Cobbley.  He has 22 years o=
f technical management experience at Intel and has been asked to take over =
for David Stewart and will transfer the advisory role from Dave to Dave.



* Team Sharing - 10 min
Sean - public announcement from AMD about one of the boards they support fo=
r the Yocto Project.
Michael - New HW is now installed and set up to allow 2 AutoBuilder environ=
ments.  Yahoo has changed its mail policy and you might see SPAM if you are=
 using a yahoo address to access Yocto Project.

